<p><a href="https://learn.microsoft.com/cpp/porting/github-copilot-modernization-cpp/overview">GitHub Copilot modernization for C++</a> is out of preview as of Visual Studio 2026 version 18.7. This agent, accessible by typing <code>@Modernize</code> in the Copilot Chat window, can be used to upgrade your projects to use a newer version of the Microsoft C++ (MSVC) Build Tools.</p>
